{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UeWbKk8BoxTG5fQfWijimt","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search through the context filesystem, I found the answer:\\\\n\\\\n## Answer\\\\n\\\\nWhen the `--cluster-id` flag is used with the storage formatting tool in the KIP-1262 proposal to let brokers and observer controllers skip storage formatting before startup, the formatter writes **meta.properties v2 (version 2)**.\\\\n\\\\n## Source Citations\\\\n\\\\n1. **[window-65-summary.md](window-65-summary.md)** (lines 295-299):\\\\n   > \\\\\\\"### KIP-1262 Related Configuration\\\\n   > - `--cluster-id` parameter for kafka-storage format command\\\\n   > - **meta.properties v2 format with cluster ID field**\\\\n   > - Automatic discovery of cluster ID via metadata records\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n2. **[kips-and-discussions.md](kips-and-discussions.md)** (line 1372):\\\\n   > \\\\\\\"**Schema Details**: **meta.properties v2 introduced with ClusterIdRecord**\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nThe KIP-1262 proposal introduces meta.properties v2 as the new format version that includes the cluster ID field, enabling brokers and observer controllers to auto-discover cluster identity information rather than requiring manual storage formatting before startup.\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"store\\\",\\\"README.md\\\",\\\"kips-and-discussions.md\\\",\\\"window-65-summary.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":35.63,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":3,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":278996,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":37460,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.1145316,\\\"input_tokens\\\":82,\\\"output_tokens\\\":2326}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9f7f7513-864b-484b-8508-25c72d33b79c","uuid":"84cef351-4448-4cea-af1e-cd8dae31060a","timestamp":"2026-09-27T18:27:54.184Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on my search through the context filesystem, I found the answer:\\\\n\\\\n## Answer\\\\n\\\\nWhen the `--cluster-id` flag is used with the storage formatting tool in the KIP-1262 proposal to let brokers and observer controllers skip storage formatting before startup, the formatter writes **meta.properties v2 (version 2)**.\\\\n\\\\n## Source Citations\\\\n\\\\n1. **[window-65-summary.md](window-65-summary.md)** (lines 295-299):\\\\n   > \\\\\\\"### KIP-1262 Related Configuration\\\\n   > - `--cluster-id` parameter for kafka-storage format command\\\\n   > - **meta.properties v2 format with cluster ID field**\\\\n   > - Automatic discovery of cluster ID via metadata records\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n2. **[kips-and-discussions.md](kips-and-discussions.md)** (line 1372):\\\\n   > \\\\\\\"**Schema Details**: **meta.properties v2 introduced with ClusterIdRecord**\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\nThe KIP-1262 proposal introduces meta.properties v2 as the new format version that includes the cluster ID field, enabling brokers and observer controllers to auto-discover cluster identity information rather than requiring manual storage formatting before startup.\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"store\\\",\\\"README.md\\\",\\\"kips-and-discussions.md\\\",\\\"window-65-summary.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":35.63,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":3,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":278996,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":37460,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.1145316,\\\"input_tokens\\\":82,\\\"output_tokens\\\":2326}}\"}","_meta":{"fastmcp":{"wrap_result":true}},"structuredContent":{"result":"{\"answer\":\"Based on my search through the context filesystem, I found the answer:\\n\\n## Answer\\n\\nWhen the `--cluster-id` flag is used with the storage formatting tool in the KIP-1262 proposal to let brokers and observer controllers skip storage formatting before startup, the formatter writes **meta.properties v2 (version 2)**.\\n\\n## Source Citations\\n\\n1. **[window-65-summary.md](window-65-summary.md)** (lines 295-299):\\n   > \\\"### KIP-1262 Related Configuration\\n   > - `--cluster-id` parameter for kafka-storage format command\\n   > - **meta.properties v2 format with cluster ID field**\\n   > - Automatic discovery of cluster ID via metadata records\\\"\\n\\n2. **[kips-and-discussions.md](kips-and-discussions.md)** (line 1372):\\n   > \\\"**Schema Details**: **meta.properties v2 introduced with ClusterIdRecord**\\\"\\n\\nThe KIP-1262 proposal introduces meta.properties v2 as the new format version that includes the cluster ID field, enabling brokers and observer controllers to auto-discover cluster identity information rather than requiring manual storage formatting before startup.\",\"error\":null,\"files\":[\"store\",\"README.md\",\"kips-and-discussions.md\",\"window-65-summary.md\"],\"seconds\":35.63,\"truncated\":false,\"turns\":3,\"usage\":{\"cache_read_tokens\":278996,\"cache_write_tokens\":37460,\"cost_usd\":0.1145316,\"input_tokens\":82,\"output_tokens\":2326}}"}}}
